WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:01.767
-Well, today is Friday.

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:02.534
That's usually when I catch up

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.634
on some personal stuff,

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:04.701
you know, I check my inbox,

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:05.567
I return some emails,

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:06.434
and, of course, I send out

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:07.667
thank you notes.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:08.834
[ Cheering and applause ]
And I was running

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:10.334
a bit behind.

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:12.667
You guys mind? Can I write out
some thank you notes right now?

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:13.834
Is that okay?
-Yes.

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:14.767
[ Cheering and applause ]
Thank you very much.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:15.868
James, can I get some

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:17.167
thank you note writing music,
please?

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:18.100
[ Playing tender tune ]

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.767
Ooh.

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:20.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.701
Looking into your soul, yeah.
-Wow!

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:27.300
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.667
Thank you, Joe Biden getting
his annual physical.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.601
[ Laughter ]
Although, it got weird
when he turned, coughed,

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.033
and more documents came out.

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.200
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]
You go, "Hey."
-What?!

00:00:37.968 --> 00:00:38.968
What?!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.400
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.100
Thank you, President's Day,

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.868
for letting us come together
as a nation

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:48.400
and celebrate what matters most
to us all --

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.567
cheap mattresses.

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:52.501
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.868
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.868 --> 00:00:59.734
Thank you, hacky sacks,

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:03.067
for just being beanbag chairs
that entered the quantum realm.

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.934
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:14.133
Thank you, sour cream,
or, as I call you,

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:15.200
mean yogurt.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.868
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.968
-That's what you call it?

00:01:19.968 --> 00:01:22.367
You call it mean yogurt?
-I call sour cream --

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:24.200
-Mean yogurt.
-I call it mean yogurt.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.901
-Wow.
-That's correct.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:27.567
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.567 --> 00:01:31.267
Thank you, microwaves,
for having the door open button,

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:32.334
the minute timer button,

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:34.133
and 40 other buttons
I never use.

00:01:34.133 --> 00:01:36.067
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:37.234
Butter defrost?

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:41.267
Honey, need your butter
defrosted?

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.534
Ah, forget it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:43.801
-Figure out the way --
-Sorry to wake you.

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:44.801
Sorry to wake you up, honey.

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:46.067
Should I defrost the butter?

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:48.801
-It's 3:00 in the morning!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.801 --> 00:01:50.267
-It's 5:00 somewhere.

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:53.834
[ Laughter ]
-[ Pop ]

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:55.100
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.734
Thank you, showers,

00:01:56.734 --> 00:01:59.968
for being a great place
to take a deep breath, relax,

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.634
and think about how much
I miss my phone.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:04.133
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Mumbling ]

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:10.667
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:13.634
Thank you, scaffolding,
for answering the question

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:15.167
"What if a building had braces?"

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:18.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:19.701
[ Cymbals clash ]

00:02:22.367 --> 00:02:23.567
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:25.467
Thank you, pizza rollers,

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:28.067
for looking like my kitchen
knife hopped on a unicycle.

00:02:28.067 --> 00:02:28.901
[ Laughter and applause ]
There you have it, everybody.

00:02:28.901 --> 00:02:30.133
Those are my Thank You Notes.

